00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:46.240
<i>Junius Seven has started to move</i>.

00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:50.190
Allen... Christine...

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:54.070
I'll see you again once this is over.

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:08.040
Now fall! Our great tombstone!

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:11.590
On a world that has forgotten the voices of sorrow, that closes its eyes to reality,

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:15.010
and continues to live veiled in the shroud of deception...

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:16.770
